			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Audit Fees <span style="font-size:9pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)</sup></span></p>
