<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>SECURITY OWNERSHIP OF CERTAIN BENEFICIAL OWNERS AND MANAGEMENT</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:25pt;">The table below sets forth information, as of June&#160;8, 2026, the amount and percentage of our outstanding shares of common stock beneficially owned by (i)&#160;each person known by us to own beneficially more than 5% of our outstanding common stock, (ii)&#160;each director, (iii)&#160;each of our named executive officers, and (iv)&#160;all of our directors and executive officers as a group. Unless otherwise noted, the following table is based on 18,596,301&#160;shares issued and outstanding as of June 8, 2026.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

