<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 9pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 27pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)</sup></i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i>No bonus was earned for the fiscal years 2025&#160;and 2024, except as indicated in footnote <sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(5)</sup>.</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 9pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 27pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(2)</sup></i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i>Mr. Crenshaw's pay structure does not include a non-equity incentive pay component. Mr. Puhala earned performance awards of $142,363 for 2025&#160;performance and $122,472 for 2024 performance, respectively. Mr. Ballard separated from the Company January 31, 2025 and did not earn the performance award for 2025 performance. Mr. Ballard did not earn the performance award for 2024 performance because he separated from the Company prior to the payout.</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 9pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 27pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(3)</sup></i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i>Includes separation pay of $884,615, consulting fees of $534,600 and other pay of $61,060 pursuant to Mr. Ballard's "Release and Consulting Agreement", and employer contributed 401(k) contributions of $2,795.&#160;</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 9pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 27pt; vertical-align: top;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(4)</sup></i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><i>Consist of employer contributed 401(k) contributions.</i></td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

